      "title": "mdb: dissect max/min prices",
      "message": "mdb: dissect max/min prices\n\nDissect the max/min prices message which is part of the setup command.\n\nDisplay the amounts as raw values for now, we'll need the scale factor\nand the number of decimal places to convert these values into actual\namounts.\n\nHandle the default and expanded currency versions of max/min prices\nwithout keeping track of the negotiated currency mode.\n",
      "author_name": "Martin Kaiser",
      "author_email": "wireshark@kaiser.cx",
      "authored_date": "2023-09-19T16:23:10.000+02:00",
